    <string name="help_title">Supported firmware</string>
    <string name="help_text">• Android 2.3, 4.0–4.4 — fully supported; 5.x–6.x — experimental.\n• 32-bit ARM firmware only (armeabi / armeabi-v7a).\n\nFormats:\n• CWM/TWRP ZIPs (MIUI, CyanogenMod, ports, and most custom ROMs);\n• Samsung: Odin .tar / .tar.md5 or ZIP containing AP_*.tar.md5;\n• Google factory images (.tgz / .zip);\n• system.img (ext4, sparse), TWRP system.ext4.win backup;\n• OTA with system.new.dat(.br) + system.transfer.list.\n\nFor best results, the archive should contain boot.img — it is used to determine the service startup order.</string>
